id: arcosian-raised
name: Arcosian-Raised
order: 2
category: mind
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait.
importance: secondary
description: >
  Under the tutelage of the brutal Arcosian race, you have learned to overwhelm enemies by targeting their weak points.
text: >
  Arcosian-Raised (Mind): Under the tutelage of the brutal Arcosian race, you have learned to overwhelm enemies by targeting their weak points.
  (1)-[Triggered, 3/Round]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T) until the end of your turn.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you would use the Signature Technique Maneuver after triggering the first effect of Arcosian-Raised twice during this Combat Round, you may increase the Damage Category of that Attacking Maneuver by 1 Category.

---

[passive]
# (2) A Signature Technique declared after (1) twice this Round: asked, once a Round - a Damage Category up (chat.mjs postAttack).
allow arcosianRaised.category;

# (1) An Opponent hit (hit-opponent): a stack of its mark - Wound 1(T) each - till the end of your turn, counted for (2) (chat.mjs
# arcosianHit). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/hit-opponent, 3/round, effect 1]
arcosianHit();
